   "contacts": "hard floor and robot_floor_carpet use time-constant solrefs, whose force per depth scales with 1 / invweight0: time_constant_contact_stiffness_ratio is the plant's foot contact stiffness over the screened model's (and carpet.standing_check's); the piles' probes are re-derived on the plant model (carpet.pile_floor, from the left foot's invweight0) and keep carpet.py's stiffness (pile_probe_stiffness_ratio), while their damping scales with 1 / sqrt(invweight0) and their regularisation inertia d0 / ((1 - d0) invweight0) with 1 / invweight0: pile_probe_damping_ratio and pile_probe_regularisation_ratio are the plant's over the screened model's (MuJoCo's efc_KBIP and efc_R give the same ratios)",
   "feedforward": "the references' inverse dynamics has the screened armature; replays add (A_plant - A_screened) qdd_ref (gates.replay)"
  }
